From 7b15d791a52429bd63d6957cccda1cf76139dffc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:20:54 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(2d): add 2D shape-mask verifier and PNG diff reporter

Add test-only shape-mask verification under crates/motion/tests/common/
with a pure-Rust uncompressed RGB PNG diff writer, integration tests
covering #1731/#1735 shapes and generator mask assertions in
trochoid_slot and adaptive_hsm, plus AGENTS.md testing documentation.

Fixes #1768
